sequenceDiagram
    actor App as Flutter App
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Fn as citas-crud Lambda
    participant DB as CitasTable DynamoDB

    Note over App,DB: POST /citas/cancion-semana — Registrar cancion

    App->>GW: POST body titulo artista link setBy weekKey
    GW->>Fn: invoke  rawPath=/citas/cancion-semana
    Fn->>Fn: inyecta type=cancion_semana
    Fn->>Fn: validate_cita weekKey YYYY-WNN + link spotify.com
    Fn->>DB: scan FilterExpression type=cancion_semana AND weekKey=2026-W24

    alt weekKey ya tiene cancion registrada
        DB-->>Fn: item existente
        Fn-->>GW: 409 Conflict
        GW-->>App: message ya existe existing_id
    else semana disponible
        DB-->>Fn: lista vacia
        Fn->>DB: put_item id tipo titulo artista link setBy weekKey
        DB-->>Fn: OK
        Fn-->>GW: 201 Created
        GW-->>App: id weekKey
    end

    Note over App,DB: GET /citas/cancion-semana/current — Cancion activa

    App->>GW: GET /citas/cancion-semana/current
    GW->>Fn: invoke  rawPath=/citas/cancion-semana/current
    Fn->>Fn: current_week_key devuelve 2026-W24
    Fn->>DB: scan FilterExpression type=cancion_semana AND weekKey=2026-W24

    alt cancion encontrada
        DB-->>Fn: item cancion_semana
        Fn-->>GW: 200 OK
        GW-->>App: titulo artista link setBy weekKey
    else sin cancion esta semana
        DB-->>Fn: lista vacia
        Fn-->>GW: 404 Not Found
        GW-->>App: message sin cancion weekKey
    end

    Note over App,DB: GET /citas/cancion-semana — Historial completo

    App->>GW: GET /citas/cancion-semana
    GW->>Fn: invoke
    Fn->>DB: scan FilterExpression type=cancion_semana
    DB-->>Fn: lista todas las canciones
    Fn->>Fn: sort por weekKey descendente
    Fn-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>App: items count lista ordenada